@startuml CareArm_Feeding_Sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAF9F6
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam defaultFontName Inter
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign center

title <b>CareArm (Team 6) — End-to-End Feeding & Safety Flow</b>

actor "Diner" as Diner
participant "Web Console\n(Voice + UI)" as UI
participant "Guardrail\n(<1 ms)" as Guard
participant "Claude Agent\n(MCP Client)" as Claude
participant "RobotTools +\nSafety Layer" as Tools
participant "3-Camera Vision\n(Table/Gripper/OBSBOT)" as Vision
participant "ElRobot Arm\n(NormaCore Station)" as Arm

== 1. Voice Request & Scope Guardrail ==
Diner -> UI : Speaks: "Give me a grape"
UI -> UI : gpt-transcribe (EN/DE) + chime
UI -> Guard : classify_intent(transcript)

alt Off-topic or Prompt Injection
    Guard --> UI : BLOCKED (<1 ms, 0 LLM calls)
    UI --> Diner : Spoken scope reminder
else Valid Feeding Request
    Guard -> Claude : <user_voice_transcript>Give me a grape</user_voice_transcript>

    == 2. Scene Check & Verified Pick ==
    Claude -> Tools : look("table")
    Tools -> Vision : Capture Table Cam + food boxes
    Vision --> Claude : Grape bowl confirmed
    Claude --> UI : "Picking a grape now." (TTS)
    Claude -> Tools : play_sequence("grapes")
    Tools -> Arm : Approach & grasp grape (clamped speed & load guard)
    Tools -> Vision : analyze_gripper_roi() (<5 ms LAB contrast)
    Vision --> Tools : Grasp confirmed (or bounded ±2% align_base retry)

    == 3. Safe Standoff & MediaPipe Mouth-Open Gate ==
    Tools -> Arm : Move to 5–10 cm standoff pose (feed_3)
    UI --> Diner : Amber banner + TTS:\n"Ready. Open your mouth when you want the bite."

    loop Every frame (~30 FPS) up to timeout (12 s)
        Tools -> Vision : Check OBSBOT MediaPipe MAR
        alt Face lost > 0.6 s
            Vision --> Tools : FACE_LOST watchdog
            Tools -> Arm : Hold pose & abort cleanly
        else Mouth OPEN confirmed (MAR >= 0.26, 3 frames)
            Vision --> Tools : mouth_open_confirmed = true
            Tools -> Arm : Deliver bite gently & open gripper
            Tools -> Arm : Retract to safe reset pose
            Tools --> Claude : Sequence complete (ok=true)
            Claude --> UI : "Enjoy! Let me know when you want another."
        end
    end
end

== Emergency Override (Active at Any Millisecond) ==
Diner -[#DC2626]> UI : Speaks "Stop!" or presses Red E-Stop
UI -[#DC2626]> Tools : POST /api/stop -> stop_now() [Bypasses Claude]
Tools -[#DC2626]> Arm : hold() all 8 ST3215 servos (<0.5 s, arm never drops)
UI -[#DC2626]-> Diner : Descending chime + "Stopped safely."

@enduml
